# Build context for sidecar/Dockerfile (Docker reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore
# next to the Dockerfile). The context is the repository root, so this sends
# the daemon only the files the image copies: never sidecar/.env with the
# association's key, never .git or .venv. Add a line here with every new COPY.
*
!sidecar/requirements.txt
!sidecar/__init__.py
!sidecar/app.py
!nostr/__init__.py
!nostr/crypto.py
!nostr/events.py
!nostr/nip98.py
